\description{
Turns a count history into the pieces that site-occupancy and abundance
models use: the response \code{y} (sites by occasions), the site covariates
\code{siteCovs} and the observation covariates \code{obsCovs}. It handles one species
or several, and one season or several. pamflow does not fit these models; use
the prepared input with the package you prefer, such as \code{unmarked}, \code{ubms} or
